WEBVTT

00:02:00.036 --> 00:02:03.556
And those visionary fishermen
are better off now.

00:02:07.316 --> 00:02:11.036
From diving tourism inside the reserve
and better fishing around it.

00:02:12.236 --> 00:02:14.396
But today, globally,

00:02:14.436 --> 00:02:17.156
only seven percent of the ocean

00:02:17.196 --> 00:02:20.756
and less than a fifth of our land
have been protected.

00:02:21.836 --> 00:02:24.356
That means that we have converted
most of our planet

00:02:24.356 --> 00:02:26.476
into a tame environment,

00:02:27.236 --> 00:02:31.556
where 96 percent of the mass
of the mammals is us